Greater Kampala paratransit study, GIS layers, 2019-2020
--------------------------------------------------------

Datasets: taxi_trips (the study's 587 one-way minibus taxi and bus trips
on 397 routes in Greater Kampala, Uganda, each with its route, the stages
it starts and ends at, the vehicle, its length and the fare for the whole
trip in the first quarter of 2020) and stages (the 110 stages, taxi parks
and terminals, the trips start and end at, each with the number of trips
starting and ending there)

Publisher: DigitalTransport4Africa's Kampala repository, which holds the
GIS layers, GTFS feed and transit maps of the "Study of the Paratransit
Transport System and Street Usage in the Kampala Metropolitan Area",
collected by MapUganda and Transport for Cairo, under a consortium led by
Transitec, in late 2019 and early 2020, sponsored by the French
Development Agency (AFD).
https://gitlab.com/digitaltransport/data/africa/kampala

